{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t啟德德朗邨德瑤樓一名90多歲婦人，昨日懷疑曾被外籍女子用手襲擊後死亡，涉案女子被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方將案件列謀殺案跟進調查，稍後召開記者會公布案情。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T05:58:23.671477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:36:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:18:00.048403+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"4a464c8137a1bbcbc8ae588e1a4ed1e59e260903f9df85f25faa98b1d4a6a6a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}